@startuml sequence_stop_container_owned
title Stop Service Discovery - ProxyContainer Owns ProxyData

skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F7F7
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #666666
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #777777
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EFEFEF

participant "App" as App #CFE8FF
participant "RequestedProxies" as Requested
participant "ProxyContainer" as Container
participant "ProxyData" as ProxyData
participant "StopServiceDiscoveryAction" as StopAction
participant "ActiveServiceDiscovery" as ActiveSD
participant "FindStrategy" as Strategy
participant "ProxyHolder" as Holder

== Build Output Consumed ==

alt Mandatory path (Single/Variant)
App -> Requested : WaitForMandatoryProxies(stop_token)
Requested --> App : ProxyContainer
note over App, Container
No StopServiceDiscovery() API is exposed for mandatory holders.
Internal stop resources are released when mandatory resolution completes.
end note
ActiveSD -> Strategy : StopFind()
Strategy -> Holder : StopFindService()

else Optional/Multiple non-owning path
App -> Requested : GetProxyContainer()
Requested --> App : ProxyContainer

alt Multiple referred
App -> Container : Get<Multiple>()
Container --> App : MultiInstanceHolder
else Optional referred
App -> Container : Get<Optional>()
Container --> App : ProxyFuture
end

note over App, Container
Explicit stop API is not available on these returned references.
Stop action remains owned by ProxyData inside ProxyContainer.
end note

== App Termination / Destructors ==

note over App, ProxyData
As App shutdown starts, ProxyContainer and ProxyData destructors will be called.
end note

ProxyData -> StopAction : Stop()
StopAction -> ActiveSD : Stop()
ActiveSD -> Strategy : StopFind()
Strategy -> Holder : StopFindService()

note over ProxyData, StopAction
StopServiceDiscovery() behavior is idempotent.
Repeated stop requests are safe.
end note
end

@enduml
